silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_24_rosetta_stone_cross_domain_sections_04_governance_policy_entry_point_concrete_anchor_1#candidate_vet_record silm:hasLongDescription "The Candidate_vet_record is the candidate object: a draft vet record for Mittens awaiting compliance certification. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Candidate_vet_record', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
